    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88235" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προπαρα-λαμβάνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>receive from</i> another <i>before,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				49.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>anticipate</i> the menstrual period, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.21
			</span></i> (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προλαμβ-</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προπαραλαμβανόμεναι ὑποθέσεις</span>
			<i>previously assumed . . ,</i> [<i><span class="en">
				Ammon.
			</span></i>] <i><span class="en">
				<u>in Apr.</u>
				67.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ληφθεισῶν τῶν . . ἐμπλάστρων</span>”
				<i>previously employed,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orib.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					49
				</span></i>
			.</div>
